flowchart LR
  dev[Push to GitHub] --> checkout[Checkout]
  checkout --> install[npm ci]
  install --> prisma[Prisma generate and migrate]
  prisma --> lint[Lint]
  lint --> build[Next.js build]
  build --> image[Docker image build]
  image --> cluster[Kubernetes rolling update]
  cluster --> monitor[Prometheus scrape and Grafana]
